--[[
    3D LIBRARY
    ==========
    Physical Workspace Part + SurfaceGui

    Features:
    - Window Part uses the exact name passed to CreateLib()
    - Always CanCollide = false
    - Always CanTouch = false
    - CanQuery = true for mouse raycast
    - RMB interaction
    - Hidden window follows player
    - Visible window stays in world
    - Fade in / fade out
    - Window distance setting
    - Window height setting
    - Window size setting
    - Fade speed setting
    - Rebindable open/close key
    - Better 3D mouse detection
    - Slider drag
    - Tabs
    - Sections
    - Button
    - Toggle
    - Slider
    - Dropdown
    - TextBox
    - Keybind
    - ColorPicker
    - Label
]]

